[SPEAKER_00]: It's like, well, you are justified in agreeability, but you're not justified if you don't see the line where agreeability is and where sensuality is.

131
00:10:37,254 --> 00:10:42,798
[SPEAKER_00]: So, you can have things that are agreeable, that are not sensual, and you can't have sensual things that are not agreeable.

132
00:10:43,118 --> 00:10:46,060
